OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after tiger attack at
OL,4,Awildlife park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being attacked by
OL,7,Fa tiger at Yorkshire Wildlife Park,
OL,8,Fpolice have confirmed.
OL,10,FThe man was seen entering the tiger
OL,11,Fenclosure at the park near Doncaster
OL,12,Fjust before police were called at 13:35
OL,13,FBST on Saturday.
OL,15,FSouth Yorkshire Police said the tiger
OL,16,Fthen attacked the man and he died at
OL,17,Fthe scene. The animal was uninjured and
OL,18,Fremained in the enclosure following the
OL,19,Fincident - but the park was closed and
OL,20,Fwill remain shut for the rest of the
OL,21,Fweekend.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
